        <briefdescription>
<para>Combine one chunk of data into the current in-flight hash. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This merges one chunk of data into the hash. First it tries to buffer the data. If the buffer is full, it hashes the buffer into its <ref refid="structllvm_1_1hashing_1_1detail_1_1hash__state" kindref="compound">hash_state</ref>, empties it, and then merges the new chunk in. This also handles cases where the data straddles the end of the buffer. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
