    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper class to manage the recursive combining of hash_combine arguments. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class exists to manage the state and various calls involved in the recursive combining of arguments used in hash_combine. It is particularly useful at minimizing the code in the recursive calls to ease the pain caused by a lack of variadic functions. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
